deadly anomalies, and survivors waiting to be rescued are scattered across a <strong>procedurally generated world</strong> that never repeats. Every run brings new routes, new dangers, and new reasons to keep the train running.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape EverRail with us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exomoon is called Inara because the community chose that name. The lore exists because players helped us refine it. Throughout Early Access, EverRail is built alongside the players. Features, systems, game balance, and story will continue to evolve based on the community that keeps the train running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So join our Steam Community and Discord and shape the game with us!<i><strong> </strong></i></p>", "short_description": "Every passenger is a life. Every death brings the end closer. An open world survival crafting game where you explore, scavenge, and craft to endure on the frozen exomoon Inara. Command and upgrade your ever-moving train, solo or with up to 4 players. Move or freeze.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/92e87e444fb654a6f0428cd4c8d634f08b39629f/header.jpg?t=1788283143", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/85dd3a4733f165a6e30daded5c15ea63614cbabe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788283143", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134600/85dd3a4733f165a6e30daded5c15ea63614cbabe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788283143", "website": "https://aesir-interactive.com/games/19/everrail", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit or later (Wind